-- slotted.d.luau: type definitions for the `slotted.*` Lua API.
--
-- Generated by `cargo xtask luau-stubs`. Do not edit; edit the `@luau` tags in
-- crates/slotted-script/prelude/slotted.lua and slotted_test.lua instead.
--
-- Point luau-lsp at this file to get completion and type errors over a mod's
-- data.lua, control.lua and tests/*.lua:
--
--     luau-lsp analyze --definitions=slotted.d.luau data.lua control.lua
